      "notes": "SETUP REQUIRED: (1) create a Header Auth credential named 'HeyGen API' with Header Name 'X-Api-Key' and your HeyGen API key as the value; (2) replace avatar_id and voice_id below with your own HeyGen avatar/voice IDs (Labs → Avatars / Voices in HeyGen — note avatar_id and voice_id are two different IDs even for the same avatar).",
